# products.md

## Purpose

This file defines how Revtek's product catalog should be understood and referenced by AI.

Revtek provides and/or sources automotive products for premium and performance-oriented vehicles, including styling, body, carbon-fiber, performance-related, and other aftermarket products.

The exact product catalog should always be treated as the source of truth for current products.

## Product Information

Each product should ideally contain:

* Product name
* Product ID / SKU
* Product category
* Brand / manufacturer
* Vehicle make
* Vehicle model
* Vehicle generation
* Vehicle year compatibility
* Product description
* Material
* Finish
* Product specifications
* Included components
* Installation requirements
* Availability
* Cost
* Selling price
* Lead time
* Product images
* Supplier/source
* Notes

## Product Status

Products may be classified as:

* Active
* Available to order
* Made to order
* Pre-order
* Out of stock
* Discontinued
* To confirm

Do not assume availability from historical information.

## Product Claims

AI must not invent:

* Materials
* Performance improvements
* Weight savings
* Fitment
* Compatibility
* Manufacturing origin
* Certification
* Warranty
* Exclusivity
* Availability
* Pricing

These must come from the relevant product source.

## Product Source of Truth

Primary product information:

`data/products/`

Supporting information may come from:

* Supplier information
* Manufacturer documentation
* Product quotations
* Internal product sheets
* Project records

When sources conflict, flag the conflict rather than silently choosing one.

